  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8294740",
      "title": "Adding a \"MealItem\" Component",
      "sourceHash": "7ac3991d965e1db658b9dc409f2352b922b534bb6085aca42437aa9a02f41dc2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 1.95,
          "en": "So now that we're able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.95,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "to successfully fetch that meals data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 10.46,
          "en": "a good next step would be to output more meal details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.62,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "here on this screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 15.963,
          "en": "to also show the description, the image, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.46,
          "end": 21.96,
          "en": "And for that, since that will be quite some markup to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 25.89,
          "en": "I'll add a brand new component here, which is optional,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "you could also add that markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "which I'm about to add in a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 34.71,
          "en": "here in the meals component in that list item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.71,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "but I'll add a new component instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 39.93,
          "en": "which I'll name MealItem.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 43.95,
          "en": "And the idea then simply is that in the Meals.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.95,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "we output a bunch of meal items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 49.953,
          "en": "basically one meal item per loaded meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 55.2,
          "en": "So in the MealItem.jsx file we can, again, export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.2,
          "end": 58.167,
          "en": "a default component function, MealItem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "and then in here, for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 65.73,
          "en": "I simply wanna return the markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.73,
          "end": 68.49,
          "en": "that should define such a meal item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.49,
          "end": 70.173,
          "en": "in that list of meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.25,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "So every meal item should be a list item here for a start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 78.9,
          "en": "and on every list item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.9,
          "end": 82.503,
          "en": "I wanna have a CSS class of meal-item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "And I'm adding this class here, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.7,
          "en": "because in index.css you'll find this class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 92.25,
          "en": "being selected in CSS rules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 95.07,
          "en": "and those rules then will make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.07,
          "end": 97.68,
          "en": "that those items look good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.68,
          "end": 100.65,
          "en": "And you also see some related rules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.65,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "for example, that we seem to have an article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "in every meal item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 108.273,
          "en": "at least here in the CSS code I provided to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.51599999999999,
          "end": 113.58,
          "en": "Therefore here, I'll actually wrap an article element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.58,
          "end": 118.25999999999999,
          "en": "around all the other content that makes up a meal item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.25999999999999,
          "end": 120.813,
          "en": "and I'll then start by outputting an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 124.35,
          "en": "And of course, the source of that image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.35,
          "end": 127.14,
          "en": "should now be received as an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 130.98,
          "en": "to that component as a prop, therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.98,
          "end": 135.51,
          "en": "because of course the meal data lives in the meals jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.51,
          "end": 138.42000000000002,
          "en": "and we kind of need to pass that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.42000000000002,
          "end": 140.403,
          "en": "to the meal item component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "So here we should definitely expect to get some props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "and it's now up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 151.392,
          "en": "whether you expect to get a name prop, a price prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.392,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "an image prop, and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 158.28,
          "en": "or if you expect to get a single meal prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.28,
          "end": 160.8,
          "en": "which then contains all these different fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.8,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "as properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 165.18,
          "en": "That really comes down to preference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.18,
          "end": 168.78,
          "en": "and here I will go for this single meal prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.78,
          "end": 171.54,
          "en": "and, therefore, the source of my image here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.54,
          "end": 173.853,
          "en": "will be meal.image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "And it will be meal image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 179.61,
          "en": "because in that dummy backend data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 183.6,
          "en": "you'll see that every meal has a image property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.6,
          "end": 188.43,
          "en": "and then also a description, price, name and ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.43,
          "end": 191.04,
          "en": "So back in MealItem.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.04,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "we can now also set the alt text of that image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 199.52,
          "en": "maybe to meal.name, and then below that image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.91,
          "end": 203.13,
          "en": "output the title of the meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.13,
          "end": 208.13,
          "en": "though for styling purposes I'll wrap that into a div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.23,
          "end": 211.47,
          "en": "And then here, between those h3 three tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.47,
          "end": 213.213,
          "en": "I'll output meal.name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.86,
          "end": 217.38,
          "en": "Below that I then wanna have a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 219.51,
          "en": "where I output the price,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.51,
          "end": 221.16,
          "en": "and for that here I'll give this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.16,
          "end": 225.66,
          "en": "a class name of meal-item-price,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.66,
          "end": 230.04,
          "en": "again, another class you'll find in the CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.04,
          "end": 234.3,
          "en": "and then here we can output that meal price,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.3,
          "end": 237.9,
          "en": "though, I'll make sure to format it in a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.9,
          "end": 240.24,
          "en": "but for the moment I'll just output it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.24,
          "end": 243.3,
          "en": "and then below that have another paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.3,
          "end": 246.123,
          "en": "where we can output the meal description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.77,
          "end": 252.12,
          "en": "This paragraph should also receive a CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 252.12,
          "end": 255.813,
          "en": "of meal-item-description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.27,
          "end": 260.19,
          "en": "So this is taking shape,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 260.19,
          "end": 264.54,
          "en": "as a last step, already, below this div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 267,
          "en": "I'll add another paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267,
          "end": 271.92,
          "en": "which will receive a class name of meal-item-actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 271.92,
          "end": 274.03,
          "en": "where I wanna add a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275.46,
          "end": 279.39,
          "en": "which should allow me to add this meal to the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 279.39,
          "end": 283.02,
          "en": "Of course, at the moment the button won't do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.02,
          "end": 285.123,
          "en": "but that will change in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 288.36,
          "end": 291.243,
          "en": "And that's how such a meal item could look like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.32,
          "end": 295.77,
          "en": "Now we can go back to Meals.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 295.77,
          "end": 297.903,
          "en": "and use that meal item there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 298.74,
          "end": 301.65,
          "en": "Instead of outputting those list items here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 301.65,
          "end": 305.613,
          "en": "I'll output my meal items which I just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 309.81,
          "en": "And every meal item should of course receive a key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 309.81,
          "end": 312.453,
          "en": "which still can be meal.id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.68,
          "end": 315.72,
          "en": "and then, in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 315.72,
          "end": 319.32,
          "en": "since I'm expecting that single meal prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 319.32,
          "end": 323.28,
          "en": "every meal item should also get this meal prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.28,
          "end": 325.77,
          "en": "which can be set equal to the meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 325.77,
          "end": 327.753,
          "en": "we're getting here in that loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.85,
          "end": 332.07,
          "en": "Of course, you also must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.07,
          "end": 336.9,
          "en": "that the meal item is imported from MealItem.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 336.9,
          "end": 341.76,
          "en": "and with that out of the way, if you reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.76,
          "end": 345.6,
          "en": "you should see something like this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.6,
          "end": 349.293,
          "en": "And, as you can see, clearly the images are missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 350.19,
          "end": 354.24,
          "en": "Now they are missing because in my backend data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 354.24,
          "end": 357.84000000000003,
          "en": "I just got a relative path to those images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 357.84000000000003,
          "end": 361.83,
          "en": "seen relative from on the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.83,
          "end": 365.493,
          "en": "But we're now loading those images from the frontend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 366.51,
          "end": 371.19,
          "en": "So we in the end need to prepend this image path here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 371.19,
          "end": 375.36,
          "en": "on the frontend by also adding the backend URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 375.36,
          "end": 378.66,
          "en": "And for this we can use the template literal feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 378.66,
          "end": 383.19,
          "en": "provided by JavaScript by using backticks here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 383.19,
          "end": 386.01,
          "en": "so not single quotes but backticks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 386.01,
          "end": 389.01,
          "en": "which allows us to easily create a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 389.01,
          "end": 392.013,
          "en": "where parts of that string are dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 393.03,
          "end": 395.25,
          "en": "And I'll start with the hard-coded part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 395.25,
          "end": 400.25,
          "en": "which is that backend URL, localhost:3000/,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 401.19,
          "end": 404.64,
          "en": "and then thereafter I'll inject meal.image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 404.64,
          "end": 408.573,
          "en": "which is that image path that's different for every meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 410.46,
          "end": 412.89,
          "en": "And now by making this change here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 412.89,
          "end": 415.23,
          "en": "by changing the image source like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 415.23,
          "end": 419.76,
          "en": "if we now save this we should also see those images here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 419.76,
          "end": 424.26,
          "en": "and that's already looking a lot better, I'd say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 424.26,
          "end": 426.483,
          "en": "I'm already getting hungry here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 430.11,
          "end": 434.31,
          "en": "And therefore we made another huge step forward,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 434.31,
          "end": 435.99,
          "en": "and as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 435.99,
          "end": 439.05,
          "en": "we could therefore start working on the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 439.05,
          "end": 442.02,
          "en": "but I'm not going to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 442.02,
          "end": 445.59,
          "en": "Instead, what about these buttons here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 445.59,
          "end": 448.53,
          "en": "I'd argue they don't look that great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 448.53,
          "end": 452.07,
          "en": "and that's therefore what I'd like to change first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 452.07,
          "end": 454.8,
          "en": "along with that price formatting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 454.8,
          "end": 457.623,
          "en": "before we then start working on the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}